{"seq":3,"slug":"layered-context-files","title":"分层的上下文文件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/context-files-as-agent-onboarding/layered-context-files","wordCount":1716,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分层的上下文文件\">分层的上下文文件</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>上下文文件不该是一坨塞满一切的大文件。真实项目的知识天然带作用域：技术栈与构建命令是全局的，某个服务的密钥轮换规矩只有那个目录关心。分层组织——全局放根级、局部就近放——让 agent 在每个工作点读到「恰好相关」的集合。这不只是洁癖：各工具的实现已经把分层做成了硬机制，预算上限、按需加载、最近优先，全都默认你会分层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分层建立在三个基础概念上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>作用域分层</strong>：技术栈与构建命令是全局的，某个服务的密钥轮换规矩只属于那个目录；每层只放该层的。</li>\n<li><strong>信噪比与预算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>相关</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>装载</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = T_{\\text{相关}} / T_{\\text{装载}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">装载</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且实际装载量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>loaded</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{loaded} = \\min(\\sum|f_i|,\\ B_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loaded</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——分层通过抬高分子、压低分母同时优化两者，超限后尾部内容被静默丢弃。</li>\n<li><strong>按需加载</strong>：启动即载之外还有访问触发与模式匹配两种时机，低频内容可以只在被需要的那一刻进场。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：分层不是文件美学，而是各家引擎共同的运行假设——预算有限、按需加载、就近优先。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要分层-过载会真实地降低质量\">为什么要分层：过载会真实地降低质量</h2><p>两条已核验的证据链。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>长而杂的指令会降低遵循度</strong>。Anthropic 文档直接给出量化口径：&quot;target under 200 lines per CLAUDE.md file. Longer files consume more context and reduce adherence&quot;，超过 4 MiB 的文件干脆跳过（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">memory 文档</a>）。它的 auto memory 设计走得更极端：索引 <code>MEMORY.md</code> 只装载<strong>前 200 行或 25KB</strong>，细节全部下沉到 topic 文件、用到再读——官方在用行动宣告：常驻上下文必须小。</p>\n<p>其二，<strong>无差别压缩也不行</strong>。ACE 论文（arXiv:2510.04618）指出两个失败模式：<em>brevity bias</em>——压缩成摘要时丢掉领域细节；<em>context collapse</em>——对上下文反复重写会逐渐侵蚀信息。它的解法是结构化、增量的维护：保留细节的组织方式，而不是把所有内容挤在一个文件里来回精简。对应到工程实践就是八个字：<strong>分层存放、就地更新</strong>。</p>\n<p>定义信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>相关</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>装载</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = T_{\\text{相关}} / T_{\\text{装载}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">装载</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（与当前任务相关的 token 除以装载总量）：不分层时分子难涨、分母虚高；分层后两者同时改善——局部规则就近命中抬高分子，无关内容不再全量进窗口压低分母。预算视角同理。设路径上各层文件为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1, \\dots, f_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，工具的实际装载量是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>loaded</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>Codex</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>KiB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{loaded} = \\min\\Big(\\sum_{i=1}^{k} |f_i|,\\ B_{\\max}\\Big), \\quad B_{\\max}^{\\text{Codex}} = 32\\,\\text{KiB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loaded</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Codex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KiB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分层决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 和每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|f_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 只统计真正相关的文件——不分层的人会在不知不觉中把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 花在一堆无关规则上，超限后尾部内容被静默丢弃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么分层-四层模型\">怎么分层：四层模型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>放什么</th>\n<th>典型位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户全局</td>\n<td>个人偏好，跨所有项目</td>\n<td><code>~/.codex/AGENTS.md</code>、<code>~/.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>、<code>~/.gemini/GEMINI.md</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目根</td>\n<td>全团队共享的全局约定</td>\n<td>repo 根 <code>AGENTS.md</code> / <code>CLAUDE.md</code> / <code>GEMINI.md</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子目录</td>\n<td>仅该包/服务关心的命令与禁忌</td>\n<td><code>services/payments/AGENTS.md</code>（或 <code>AGENTS.override.md</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径规则</td>\n<td>绑定文件模式的条件规则</td>\n<td>Cursor <code>.cursor/rules/*.mdc</code> + globs；Claude <code>.claude/rules/</code> path-scoped rules</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键纪律是<strong>每层只放该层的</strong>：局部内容塞根级，等于让所有会话为它买单；全局内容抄进每个子目录，等于埋下多处漂移隐患。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph L1[&quot;第1层 · 用户全局&quot;]&#10;        U[&quot;~/.codex/AGENTS.md · ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md · ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph L2[&quot;第2层 · 项目根&quot;]&#10;        R[&quot;repo 根 AGENTS.md(跨包约定)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph L3[&quot;第3层 · 子目录&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;services/payments/AGENTS.override.md(仅此服务)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph L4[&quot;第4层 · 路径规则&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;.cursor/rules/*.mdc(globs) · .claude/rules/(path-scoped)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    U --&gt; R --&gt; S&#10;    C -. &quot;匹配文件进入上下文时才附加&quot; .-&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[\"第1层 · 用户全局\"]\n        U[\"~/.codex/AGENTS.md · ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md · ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md\"]\n    end\n    subgraph L2[\"第2层 · 项目根\"]\n        R[\"repo 根 AGENTS.md(跨包约定)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph L3[\"第3层 · 子目录\"]\n        S[\"services/payments/AGENTS.override.md(仅此服务)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph L4[\"第4层 · 路径规则\"]\n        C[\".cursor/rules/*.mdc(globs) · .claude/rules/(path-scoped)\"]\n    end\n    U --&gt; R --&gt; S\n    C -. \"匹配文件进入上下文时才附加\" .-&gt; S</pre><p>agents.md 对大型 monorepo 的官方建议正是这个形状：&quot;Place another AGENTS.md inside each package&quot;——agent 自动读取目录树上最近的文件，最近的优先；OpenAI 自己的主仓库就放了 <strong>88 个</strong> AGENTS.md（官网数据）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装载与优先级语义-各工具并不相同\">装载与优先级语义：各工具并不相同</h2><p>最容易踩坑的部分——「读哪些」和「谁赢」在三家里有三个答案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>agents.md 规范</strong>：FAQ 写死 &quot;The closest AGENTS.md to the edited file wins&quot;，且显式的用户聊天指令压倒一切文件。</li>\n<li><strong>Codex</strong>：不删除任何一层——根向下全部拼接，离 cwd 近的出现得更晚、从而在 prompt 里覆盖前面的；搜索到当前目录为止；同目录存在 override 时该目录 AGENTS.md 被忽略。</li>\n<li><strong>Claude Code</strong>：父目录启动即载、子目录按需载；<code>.claude/rules/</code> 中带 globs 的规则只在匹配文件进入上下文时附加——粒度到路径模式而不是目录。</li>\n<li><strong>Gemini CLI</strong>：JIT 层在工具触碰某文件时向上扫描到 trusted root，局部说明在被需要的那一刻才被发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>装载时机</th>\n<th>具体机制</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动即载</td>\n<td>cwd 以上的整条父目录链</td>\n<td>Claude Code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动即载</td>\n<td>项目根走到 cwd，每目录至多一份</td>\n<td>Codex</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问触发</td>\n<td>读到子目录文件时才装该目录的 CLAUDE.md</td>\n<td>Claude Code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问触发</td>\n<td>JIT 向上扫到 trusted root</td>\n<td>Gemini CLI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式匹配附加</td>\n<td>globs / path-scoped rules</td>\n<td>Cursor、Claude rules</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>预算同样是硬约束。Codex 全链条默认 32 KiB（<code>project_doc_max_bytes</code> 可调），超限即停止收录。Claude 的 <code>@import</code> 只是组织手段——原文：&quot;Splitting into imports helps organization but doesn&#39;t reduce context, since imported files load at launch&quot;。想验证层级是否如预期生效，Codex 官方教程给出的办法是在目标目录启动并让它复述指令源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"codex --cd services/payments --ask-for-approval never \\&#10;  &quot;List the instruction sources you loaded.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">codex</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> services/payments</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ask-for-approval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> never</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"List the instruction sources you loaded.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>预期输出依次是全局文件、仓库根 AGENTS.md、payments override——三层各归其位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>monorepo 从第一天就嵌套</strong>：包目录各自的 AGENTS.md 写包内命令与禁忌，根文件只留跨包规矩——别等仓库大到根文件装不下才拆。</li>\n<li><strong>想真省窗口就用条件触发</strong>：Claude 的 path-scoped rules 或 Cursor 的 auto-attach（globs 匹配才附加），而不是无条件 import——后者不减分母。</li>\n<li><strong>更新走最小作用域</strong>：局部规则变了只改局部文件，全局变了改根级，各改各的，diff 可审、冲突可定位。</li>\n<li><strong>别把临时覆盖当配置管理</strong>：override 文件是「同目录二选一」语义，用完即删；忘删会让该目录的原生规则静默失效，且从任何 diff 里都看不出问题。</li>\n<li><strong>定期抽查装载清单</strong>：Gemini 底栏计数异常增多往往是子目录文件意外膨胀；用上面的 codex 复述法核对每一层的存在感。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分层不是文件美学，而是三套引擎共同的运行假设：预算有限、按需加载、就近优先。顺着机制放内容，agent 才会在正确的地方读到正确的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../scaling-context-across-the-repo/root-vs-package-level-context\">根级与包级上下文</a>：四层模型落到仓库尺度——每层该放什么、两层怎么叠加。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../writing-effective-context/keeping-it-concise\">保持精炼</a>：为什么每一层都要小——context rot、位置偏置与低信号条目的分流去向。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分层的上下文文件","id":"分层的上下文文件"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要分层：过载会真实地降低质量","id":"为什么要分层-过载会真实地降低质量"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么分层：四层模型","id":"怎么分层-四层模型"},{"level":2,"text":"装载与优先级语义：各工具并不相同","id":"装载与优先级语义-各工具并不相同"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"AGENTS.md 及其同类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/context-files-as-agent-onboarding/agents-md-and-friends"},"next":{"title":"AGENTS.md 该写什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/writing-effective-context/what-to-put-in-agents"}}